        'es_ES' => '1.1 Nota de posventa transfronteriza: enviamos desde China continental. El retorno y los impuestos del hanfu son altos; un artículo probado es difícil de revender—confirme talla y estilo antes de pedir. Tras el envío, las devoluciones personales suelen ser difíciles; calidad, envío incorrecto o daño de transporte: lo atenderemos con cuidado. A diferencia de algunas plataformas, nuestro foco es calidad y exactitud del envío.',
        'es_MX' => '1.1 Nota de posventa transfronteriza: enviamos desde China continental. El retorno y los impuestos del hanfu son altos; un artículo probado es difícil de revender—confirme talla y estilo antes de pedir. Tras el envío, las devoluciones personales suelen ser difíciles; calidad, envío incorrecto o daño de transporte: lo atenderemos con cuidado. A diferencia de algunas plataformas, nuestro foco es calidad y exactitud del envío.',
        'et_EE' => '1.1 Cross-border after-sales note: We ship from mainland China overseas. Cross-border return freight and taxes for hanfu are high, and tried-on garments are hard to resell, so we recommend confirming size and style before ordering. After dispatch, returns for personal reasons are usually difficult to arrange; if you encounter quality issues, wrong items, or shipping damage, we will handle them carefully. Unlike no-reason returns on some platforms, our after-sales focus is product quality and shipping accuracy.',
        'fi_FI' => '1.1 Cross-border after-sales note: We ship from mainland China overseas. Cross-border return freight and taxes for hanfu are high, and tried-on garments are hard to resell, so we recommend confirming size and style before ordering. After dispatch, returns for personal reasons are usually difficult to arrange; if you encounter quality issues, wrong items, or shipping damage, we will handle them carefully. Unlike no-reason returns on some platforms, our after-sales focus is product quality and shipping accuracy.',
        'fr_CA' => '1.1 Note SAV transfrontalier : expédition depuis la Chine continentale. Retour et taxes pour le hanfu sont élevés ; un article essayé se revend mal—confirmez taille et style avant commande. Après expédition, retour pour motif personnel généralement difficile ; qualité, envoi erroné ou dommage de transport : nous traitons avec soin. Contrairement aux retours sans motif de certaines plateformes, notre SAV vise qualité et exactitude d’envoi.',
        'fr_FR' => '1.1 Note SAV transfrontalier : expédition depuis la Chine continentale. Retour et taxes pour le hanfu sont élevés ; un article essayé se revend mal—confirmez taille et style avant commande. Après expédition, retour pour motif personnel généralement difficile ; qualité, envoi erroné ou dommage de transport : nous traitons avec soin. Contrairement aux retours sans motif de certaines plateformes, notre SAV vise qualité et exactitude d’envoi.',
        'ga_IE' => '1.1 Cross-border after-sales note: We ship from mainland China overseas. Cross-border return freight and taxes for hanfu are high, and tried-on garments are hard to resell, so we recommend confirming size and style before ordering. After dispatch, returns for personal reasons are usually difficult to arrange; if you encounter quality issues, wrong items, or shipping damage, we will handle them carefully. Unlike no-reason returns on some platforms, our after-sales focus is product quality and shipping accuracy.',
        'hi_IN' => '1.1 सीमा-पार आफ्टर-सेल्स नोट: मुख्यभूमि चीन से शिपिंग। हानफू रिटर्न भाड़ा व कर अधिक; ट्राई की वस्तु फिर बेचना कठिन—ऑर्डर से पहले आकार व शैली जाँचें। भेजने के बाद व्यक्तिगत रिटर्न आमतौर पर कठिन; गुणवत्ता/गलत/क्षति पर सावधानी से मदद। कुछ प्लेटफ़ॉर्म से अलग फोकस गुणवत्ता व शिपिंग सटीकता।',
        'hr_HR' => '1.1 Cross-border after-sales note: We ship from mainland China overseas. Cross-border return freight and taxes for hanfu are high, and tried-on garments are hard to resell, so we recommend confirming size and style before ordering. After dispatch, returns for personal reasons are usually difficult to arrange; if you encounter quality issues, wrong items, or shipping damage, we will handle them carefully. Unlike no-reason returns on some platforms, our after-sales focus is product quality and shipping accuracy.',
        'hu_HU' => '1.1 Cross-border after-sales note: We ship from mainland China overseas. Cross-border return freight and taxes for hanfu are high, and tried-on garments are hard to resell, so we recommend confirming size and style before ordering. After dispatch, returns for personal reasons are usually difficult to arrange; if you encounter quality issues, wrong items, or shipping damage, we will handle them carefully. Unlike no-reason returns on some platforms, our after-sales focus is product quality and shipping accuracy.',
        'id_ID' => '1.1 Catatan purna jual lintas batas: pengiriman dari Tiongkok daratan. Ongkir dan pajak retur hanfu tinggi; barang yang dicoba sulit dijual lagi—pastikan ukuran dan gaya sebelum pesan. Setelah dikirim, retur pribadi biasanya sulit; kualitas, kiriman salah, atau kerusakan: kami bantu dengan hati-hati. Berbeda dari beberapa platform, fokus kami kualitas dan ketepatan pengiriman.',
        'is_IS' => '1.1 Cross-border after-sales note: We ship from mainland China overseas. Cross-border return freight and taxes for hanfu are high, and tried-on garments are hard to resell, so we recommend confirming size and style before ordering. After dispatch, returns for personal reasons are usually difficult to arrange; if you encounter quality issues, wrong items, or shipping damage, we will handle them carefully. Unlike no-reason returns on some platforms, our after-sales focus is product quality and shipping accuracy.',
        'it_IT' => '1.1 Nota post-vendita transfrontaliera: spedizione dalla Cina continentale. Reso e tasse per l’hanfu sono elevati; un capo provato è difficile da rivendere—confermate taglia e stile prima. Dopo la spedizione i resi personali sono di solito difficili; qualità, spedizione errata o danno di trasporto: gestiamo con cura. A differenza di alcune piattaforme, il focus è qualità e accuratezza della spedizione.',
        'lt_LT' => '1.1 Cross-border after-sales note: We ship from mainland China overseas. Cross-border return freight and taxes for hanfu are high, and tried-on garments are hard to resell, so we recommend confirming size and style before ordering. After dispatch, returns for personal reasons are usually difficult to arrange; if you encounter quality issues, wrong items, or shipping damage, we will handle them carefully. Unlike no-reason returns on some platforms, our after-sales focus is product quality and shipping accuracy.',
