        'nb_NO' => '1.1 Cross-border after-sales note: We ship from mainland China overseas. Cross-border return freight and taxes for hanfu are high, and tried-on garments are hard to resell, so we recommend confirming size and style before ordering. After dispatch, returns for personal reasons are usually difficult to arrange; if you encounter quality issues, wrong items, or shipping damage, we will handle them carefully. Unlike no-reason returns on some platforms, our after-sales focus is product quality and shipping accuracy.',
        'nl_NL' => '1.1 Cross-border aftersales-notitie: verzending vanuit vasteland China. Retourvracht en belastingen voor hanfu zijn hoog; gepaste kleding is moeilijk door te verkopen—bevestig maat en stijl vóór bestelling. Na verzending zijn persoonlijke retouren meestal moeilijk; kwaliteit, verkeerde zending of transportschade: wij helpen zorgvuldig. Anders dan sommige platforms ligt onze focus op kwaliteit en verzendnauwkeurigheid.',
        'pl_PL' => '1.1 Uwaga o obsłudze transgranicznej: wysyłka z Chin kontynentalnych. Zwrot i podatki hanfu są wysokie; przymierzony towar trudno odsprzedać—potwierdź rozmiar i model przed zamówieniem. Po wysyłce zwroty osobiste zwykle trudne; jakość, błędna wysyłka lub uszkodzenie: pomożemy starannie. W przeciwieństwie do niektórych platform fokus to jakość i dokładność wysyłki.',
        'pt_BR' => '1.1 Nota de pós-venda transfronteiriço: envio da China continental. Frete e impostos de retorno do hanfu são altos; peça experimentada é difícil de revender—confirme tamanho e estilo antes. Após o envio, devolução pessoal costuma ser difícil; qualidade, envio errado ou dano de transporte: tratamos com cuidado. Diferente de algumas plataformas, nosso foco é qualidade e precisão do envio.',
        'pt_PT' => '1.1 Nota de pós-venda transfronteiriço: envio da China continental. Frete e impostos de retorno do hanfu são altos; peça experimentada é difícil de revender—confirme tamanho e estilo antes. Após o envio, devolução pessoal costuma ser difícil; qualidade, envio errado ou dano de transporte: tratamos com cuidado. Diferente de algumas plataformas, nosso foco é qualidade e precisão do envio.',
        'ro_RO' => '1.1 Cross-border after-sales note: We ship from mainland China overseas. Cross-border return freight and taxes for hanfu are high, and tried-on garments are hard to resell, so we recommend confirming size and style before ordering. After dispatch, returns for personal reasons are usually difficult to arrange; if you encounter quality issues, wrong items, or shipping damage, we will handle them carefully. Unlike no-reason returns on some platforms, our after-sales focus is product quality and shipping accuracy.',
        'ru_RU' => '1.1 Примечание о кроссбордер-сервисе: отправка из материкового Китая. Стоимость и налоги обратной пересылки ханьфу высоки; примеренную одежду сложно перепродать — подтвердите размер и фасон до заказа. После отправки личный возврат обычно сложно оформить; качество, ошибка отправки или повреждение при перевозке — поможем внимательно. В отличие от некоторых платформ, наш фокус — качество и точность отправки.',
        'sk_SK' => '1.1 Cross-border after-sales note: We ship from mainland China overseas. Cross-border return freight and taxes for hanfu are high, and tried-on garments are hard to resell, so we recommend confirming size and style before ordering. After dispatch, returns for personal reasons are usually difficult to arrange; if you encounter quality issues, wrong items, or shipping damage, we will handle them carefully. Unlike no-reason returns on some platforms, our after-sales focus is product quality and shipping accuracy.',
        'sl_SI' => '1.1 Cross-border after-sales note: We ship from mainland China overseas. Cross-border return freight and taxes for hanfu are high, and tried-on garments are hard to resell, so we recommend confirming size and style before ordering. After dispatch, returns for personal reasons are usually difficult to arrange; if you encounter quality issues, wrong items, or shipping damage, we will handle them carefully. Unlike no-reason returns on some platforms, our after-sales focus is product quality and shipping accuracy.',
        'sv_SE' => '1.1 Cross-border after-sales note: We ship from mainland China overseas. Cross-border return freight and taxes for hanfu are high, and tried-on garments are hard to resell, so we recommend confirming size and style before ordering. After dispatch, returns for personal reasons are usually difficult to arrange; if you encounter quality issues, wrong items, or shipping damage, we will handle them carefully. Unlike no-reason returns on some platforms, our after-sales focus is product quality and shipping accuracy.',
        'tr_TR' => '1.1 Sınır ötesi satış sonrası notu: anakara Çin’den gönderim. Hanfu iade ve vergileri yüksektir; denenmiş ürün yeniden satılması zor—siparişten önce beden ve modeli doğrulayın. Gönderimden sonra kişisel iade genellikle zor; kalite, yanlış gönderim veya taşıma hasarı: dikkatle yardımcı oluruz. Bazı platformlardan farklı olarak odak kalite ve gönderim doğruluğudur.',
        'uk_UA' => '1.1 Примітка про кросбордер-сервіс: відправка з материкового Китаю. Вартість і податки зворотної пересилки ханьфу високі; приміряний одяг важко перепродати — підтвердіть розмір і фасон до замовлення. Після відправки особисте повернення зазвичай складне; якість, помилка або пошкодження — допоможемо уважно. На відміну від деяких платформ, фокус — якість і точність відправки.',
        'ur_PK' => '1.1 کراس بورڈر بعد از فروخت نوٹ: مین لینڈ چین سے شپنگ۔ ہانفو واپسی کرایہ و ٹیکس زیادہ؛ آزمائی ہوئی چیز دوبارہ بیچنا مشکل—آرڈر سے پہلے سائز و طرز تصدیق کریں۔ بھیجنے کے بعد ذاتی واپسی عموماً مشکل؛ معیار/غلط/نقصان پر احتیاط سے مدد۔ کچھ پلیٹ فارمز سے مختلف فوکس معیار و شپنگ درستگی۔',
